  "scope": "Finite project regression corpus; no competitor definitions or claims of universal coverage. Head expectations express independently checked ordinary meanings, not equality of all senses.",
  "notes": [
    "Availability, expected-head recall and ranking positions are separate metrics.",
    "Typo suggestions are an independent sidecar probe, not an assertion that the UI displayed them or automatically corrected a literal/form hit.",
