    "Chinese streams must be read to their actual end; no artificial result cap.",
    "Three historicalGap fields preserve pre-follow-up observations; current pending/resolved status is computed from actual head evidence. All235 original inputs, language/category IDs and critical exclusions are retained. Two expectation reviews document a canonical spelling and a broader Chinese employment intent."
